BOSTON SOUR                     WHISKEY        
Drink type: Cocktail Sour 
Temp: Cold 
Serve at: Brunch Cocktails Evening 
Season(s): Spring Summer Fall 
1/2 LEMON (JUICE ONLY)                    1 TSP. POWDERED SUGAR                     2 OZ. OLD THOMPSON BLENDED WHISKEY        1 EGG WHITE                                1 SOUR GLASS                              Shake with cracked ice and strain into sour    glass. Add a slice of lemon and a cherry.

BULL SHOT                       VODKA          
